doctype html
html
  head
    title New Login to Mum Mum
    style.
      .container {
        font-family: sans-serif;
        color: #333;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
  body
    div.container
      p Hi #{firstName},
      p We noticed a recent login to your Mum Mum account.
      p If this was you, you can safely ignore this email.
      p If you didn't log in recently, please reset your password immediately or contact our support team to secure your account.
